 it both new license request and XML markup, to show I'm not sure which it is and need discussion!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1659411695/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1659416531","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2053#issuecomment-1659416531","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2053","id":1659416531,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85i6K_T","user":{"login":"bsdimp","id":4139006,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzkwMDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4139006?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp","html_url":"https://github.com/bsdimp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsdimp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-08-01T01:10:43Z","updated_at":"2023-08-01T01:10:43Z","body":"Is this close at all to other bsd plus patent disclaimers? I don't see one, but you guys are way better at finding these than i","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1659416531/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,