l},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1660167561","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2053#issuecomment-1660167561","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2053","id":1660167561,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85i9CWJ","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-08-01T11:59:47Z","updated_at":"2023-08-01T11:59:47Z","body":"I agree, I would not want to include this as matching standard BSD-3-Clause via markup.\r\n\r\nIf I were interpreting the inclusion of \"patent infringement\" explicitly in that list, personally I would likely conclude that there's no difference between including it or not. But that's something that is a legal interpretation or conclusion, and I think goes over the line of what we would treat as the same license for SPDX matching purposes.\r\n\r\nI'm +1 to add it as a separate license ID. I'm kind of okay with using `BSD-3-Clause-HP` as the only other instances of this that I'm finding (from a brief search) also appear to originate from HP. Alternatively `BSD-3-Clause-hplip` might make sense as it seems like the instances I see are all part of the hplip package, e.g. https://codesearch.isocpp.org/actcd19/main/h/hplip/hplip_3.17.7+repack0-3/prnt/hpijs/dj630.h","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1660167561/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1665981681","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2053#issuecomment-1665981681","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2053","id":1665981681,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85jTNzx","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-08-04T17:54:31Z","updated_at":"2023-08-04T17:54:31Z","body":"sounds good, thanks for the comments @swinslow and @richardfontana - I'll mark this as accepted now","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos